WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:04.019
The possum looked closely at Toad.

2
00:00:04.020 --> 00:00:08.039
"Did you say you are a toad?" she asked.

3
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:10.471
She stepped closer.

4
00:00:10.472 --> 00:00:14.499
"You are a toad!" she screamed.

5
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.271
Toad backed away from her.

6
00:00:17.272 --> 00:00:21.049
"I don’t like toads at all!" she yelled.

7
00:00:21.050 --> 00:00:23.840
She grabbed him by the leg.

8
00:00:23.841 --> 00:00:28.753
"Stop! Let go of me!" cried Toad.

9
00:00:28.754 --> 00:00:33.094
She swung him around three times!

10
00:00:33.095 --> 00:00:36.235
"Ahhh," cried Toad.

11
00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.946
"I’m getting dizzy!"

12
00:00:38.947 --> 00:00:42.819
"Get off my boat!" the possum yelled.

13
00:00:42.820 --> 00:00:46.114
Then she let him go.

14
00:00:46.115 --> 00:00:49.104
Toad flew through the air.

15
00:00:49.105 --> 00:00:52.119
He went over the side of the boat.

16
00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:59.145
"Ahhh!" screamed Toad. "I’m falling!"

17
00:00:59.146 --> 00:01:03.945
With a splash, Toad fell into the water.

18
00:01:03.946 --> 00:01:05.524
Toad coughed.

19
00:01:05.525 --> 00:01:10.051
"The water is cold!" he cried.

20
00:01:10.052 --> 00:01:12.925
His bonnet was soaked.

21
00:01:12.926 --> 00:01:15.857
A lily pad covered his head.

22
00:01:15.858 --> 00:01:21.084
The possum looked back and laughed.

23
00:01:21.085 --> 00:01:26.596
"I’ll get you!" yelled Toad, shaking his fist.

24
00:01:26.597 --> 00:01:29.443
"You’ll be sorry!"

25
00:01:29.444 --> 00:01:33.893
Toad swam to shore and climbed out.

26
00:01:33.894 --> 00:01:39.849
"This dress is heavy, but I can still run!" said Toad.

27
00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:43.789
He ran along the path beside the canal.

28
00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:49.696
"Up I go!" yelled Toad as he jumped on the horse.

29
00:01:49.697 --> 00:01:54.074
"Let me untie you, horse," cried Toad.

30
00:01:54.075 --> 00:02:00.087
"Now you are as free as I am!"

31
00:02:00.088 --> 00:02:04.157
"Stop! Stop!" yelled the possum.

32
00:02:04.158 --> 00:02:09.442
"No one can stop Toad!" Toad shouted.

33
00:02:09.443 --> 00:02:15.488
And he rode away laughing.

